==Trivia==
*Trolls are named after the first thing they eat. In this case, Twig most likely ate some twigs from the [[Fremennik Province]].
*The name of Twig and their guard partner, [[Berry]], may be a reference to the phrase "twig and berries", a euphemism for male genitalia.

